# UX workflow: record absolute Automation while several shared LFOs keep running.
# Purpose: proves the normal hardware gesture no longer reports REC ERR when
# the destination already has several shared LFO assignments. Exact Undo/Redo
# isolation is covered by the native history test because Macro performance
# does not expose a local history shortcut.
# Expect: capture_changed:modulated_ready=modulated_record_active, capture_changed:modulated_record_active=modulated_record_committed

0 scenario macro-multi-modulation
80 capture screen modulated_ready

# The established hold-and-turn gesture records Base while Modulation remains
# present on the performance ring.
180 button MACRO_1 down
500 encoder MACRO_1 0.90
680 capture screen modulated_record_active
1100 button MACRO_1 up
1320 capture screen modulated_record_committed
